<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="cs">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Inventarizace dlouhodobého majetku</title>
<style>
    /* mPDF kvirky: single class names, žádné nested selectory, padding v <td> ne v <div> */
    body { font-family: montserrat, dejavusans, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; color: #15131D; }
    .header-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 3mm; }
    .header-table td { vertical-align: top; }
    .header-meta { font-size: 8pt; color: #555; }
    .header-title { font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; padding: 0 6mm; }
    .header-period { text-align: center; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 2mm; }
    .header-sub { text-align: center; font-size: 8pt; color: #555; margin-top: 1mm; }
    .legal-note { font-size: 7pt; color: #555; margin-bottom: 3mm; }
    table.book { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 3mm; }
    table.book thead th {
        font-size: 7pt; font-weight: normal; color: #555; text-align: right;
        padding: 1mm 1.5mm; border-bottom: 0.3pt solid #ccc; vertical-align: bottom;
    }
    table.book thead th.thl { text-align: left; }
    table.book tbody td {
        padding: 0.8mm 1.5mm; font-size: 8pt; border-bottom: 0.2pt solid #eee; vertical-align: top;
    }
    table.book tfoot td {
        font-weight: bold; font-size: 8pt; padding: 1.5mm 1.5mm;
        border-top: 0.5pt solid #333; border-bottom: 0.5pt solid #333;
    }
    .num { text-align: right; }
    .col-inv { width: 24mm; }
    .col-name { width: 50mm; }
    .col-date { width: 20mm; }
    .col-status { width: 22mm; }
    .sign-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 12mm; }
    .sign-cell { width: 50%; font-size: 8pt; color: #555; padding-top: 8mm; border-top: 0.3pt solid #999; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<table class="header-table">
    <tr>
        <td style="width:30%;">
            <div class="header-meta">{{ entity.name }}</div>
            <div class="header-meta">IČO: {{ entity.ico }}</div>
            <div class="header-meta">{{ entity.address }}</div>
        </td>
        <td style="width:40%;">
            <div class="header-title">Inventarizace dlouhodobého majetku</div>
            <div class="header-period">k rozvahovému dni {{ as_of|cz_date }}</div>
            <div class="header-sub">Fiskální rok {{ period.fiscal_year }} · Sestaveno: {{ entity.prepared_at }}</div>
        </td>
        <td style="width:30%;"></td>
    </tr>
</table>

<div class="legal-note">
    Inventarizace dlouhodobého majetku dle §29–30 zákona č. 563/1991 Sb., o účetnictví — soupis
    karet majetku existujících k rozvahovému dni s pořizovací cenou (VC), Σ účetními odpisy
    (oprávky) a zůstatkovou cenou (ZC).
</div>

{% if rows is empty %}
    <p style="text-align:center; color:#888; padding: 10mm 0;">
        K rozvahovému dni není v evidenci žádný dlouhodobý majetek.
    </p>
{% else %}
<table class="book">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th class="thl col-inv">Inv. číslo</th>
            <th class="thl col-name">Název</th>
            <th class="thl col-date">Pořízeno</th>
            <th class="thl col-date">Zařazeno</th>
            <th>Pořizovací cena</th>
            <th>Oprávky</th>
            <th>Zůstatková cena</th>
            <th class="thl col-status">Stav</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        {% for row in rows %}
            <tr>
                <td>{{ row.inventory_number|default('—') }}</td>
                <td>{{ row.name|slice(0, 48) }}</td>
                <td>{{ row.acquisition_date|cz_date }}</td>
                <td>{{ row.put_into_use_date|cz_date }}</td>
                <td class="num">{{ row.input_price|cz_money }}</td>
                <td class="num">{{ row.acc_amount|cz_money }}</td>
                <td class="num">{{ row.net_book_value|cz_money }}</td>
                <td>{{ row.status }}</td>
            </tr>
        {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
    <tfoot>
        <tr>
            <td colspan="4">CELKEM ({{ count }} karet)</td>
            <td class="num">{{ totals.input_price|cz_money }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ totals.acc_amount|cz_money }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ totals.net_book_value|cz_money }}</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>
    </tfoot>
</table>

<table class="sign-table">
    <tr>
        <td class="sign-cell">Inventarizaci provedl (datum, podpis)</td>
        <td class="sign-cell">Schválil (datum, podpis)</td>
    </tr>
</table>
{% endif %}

</body>
</html>
